    {
      "id": "A1-18-L2",
      "position": 2,
      "skill": "grammar",
      "title": "قاعدة: next to / behind / between / in front of",
      "est_minutes": 15,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "audio",
          "text_en": "The bed is next to the window. The mirror is behind the door. The lamp is on the table. Where is the clock?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "markdown_ar": "تعلّمنا in و on و under. وهذه حروف جر جديدة لوصف المكان:\n\n- **next to** = بجانب: The lamp is **next to** the bed.\n- **behind** = خلف: The mirror is **behind** the door.\n- **in front of** = أمام: The carpet is **in front of** the bed.\n- **between** = بين: The bed is **between** the wardrobe and the window.\n\nلنسأل عن المكان نقول: **Where is** the lamp? (أين المصباح؟) ونجيب: **It is** next to the bed.\n\n**الخطأ الشائع:** أن ننسى **the** قبل اسم معروف. نقول: **the** bed, **the** lamp عندما نتحدث عن شيء محدد."
        },
